---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Gyan Browser">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-darkcard p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
        At Gyan Browser, accessible from https://realgyanbrowser.github.io, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by Gyan Browser and how we use it.
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-2">Google AdSense & Cookies</h3>
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to our website and other sites on the internet.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
